<% content_for :title, 'Health guidance' %>

<article>
  <div class="text-block p-3">
    <h1>Health guidance</h1>
    <p>Air pollution affects us all, especially those who are more vulnerable to its health effects, and those who spend time in high pollution areas. Air pollution can have a bigger effect on older people, children, pregnant people, and those with cardio (heart) and respiratory (lung) conditions.</p>
    <p>Anyone having symptoms should follow the health guidance to reduce the effects of air pollution, pollen, extreme weather, and UV.</p>
    <div class="mb-2 mobile-only">
      <%= link_to("Sign up for air quality alerts", subscriptions_path, class: "primary-cta mt-3") %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="details-wrapper">
    <details class="px-3">
      <summary class="p-2">
        <h2 class="mb-1">Air pollution index</h2>
      </summary>
      <div class="text-block p-2">
        <p>The index used to describe air quality is the <%= link_to('daily air quality index (DAQI)', 'http://uk-air.defra.gov.uk/air-pollution/daqi') %> for the UK. It represents air pollution using a 1 to 10 scale divided into four bands: low, moderate, high, and very high.</p>

        <h2>Air pollution advice</h2>
        <p>The daily air quality index (DAQI) describes four levels of air pollution: low, moderate, high and very high.</p>
        <p>To reduce your exposure to air pollution, the bands have advice for everyone, plus for at-risk individuals including adults and children with heart or lung conditions, and older people.</p>
        <p>Sign up to receive free airTEXT alerts when there is a moderate, high or very high alert, and follow the health guidance.</p>

<div>
        <h2>At-risk individuals</h2>
        <p>Follow your doctor's advice about exercising and managing your condition.</p>
        <p>Susceptible individuals may experience health effects even on low air pollution days. Anyone having symptoms should follow the guidance provided.</p>
</div>

        <div class="scale-guide">
          <div class="headings mt-2">
            <span>Banding</span>
            <span>Value</span>
          </div>
          <section>
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>Low</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-1">1</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-2">2</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-3">3</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:air_pollution, :low)) %>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-2">
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>Moderate</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-4">4</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-5">5</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-6">6</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:air_pollution, :moderate)) %>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-2">
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>High</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-7">7</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-8">8</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-9">9</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:air_pollution, :high)) %>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-2">
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>Very high</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-10">10</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:air_pollution, :very_high)) %>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="px-3">
      <summary class="p-2">
        <h2 class="mb-1">Long-term effects of air pollution</h2>
      </summary>
      <div class="text-block p-2">
        <p>While episodes of high air pollution can lead to negative health effects, even regular long-term exposure to air pollution at lower levels can be harmful.</p>
        <p>Read the <%= link_to('Chief Medical Officer’s annual report on air pollution 2022', 'http://www.hpa.org.uk/webc/HPAwebFile/HPAweb_C/1317137020526') %>.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="px-3">
      <summary class="p-2">
        <h2 class="mb-1">The pollen forecast</h2>
      </summary>
      <div class="text-block p-2">
        <p>The pollen forecast may be low, moderate, high or very high.</p>
        <p>Between late March and September, the pollen count is at its highest, especially when it's warm, humid, and windy.</p>
        <p>Exposure to pollen grains can cause hay fever (also called seasonal allergenic rhinitis), which can last for months.</p>
        <div class="scale-guide">
          <section>
            <div class="scale">
              <h3>Low</h3>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:pollen, :low)) %>
          </section>

          <section>
            <div class="scale">
              <h3>Moderate</h3>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:pollen, :moderate)) %>
          </section>

          <section>
            <div class="scale">
              <h3>High</h3>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:pollen, :high)) %>
          </section>

          <section>
            <div class="scale">
              <h3>Very high</h3>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:pollen, :very_high)) %>
          </section>
        </div>

        <p>Learn more about <%= link_to('prevention and treatment of hay fever', 'http://www.nhs.uk/Conditions/Hay-fever/Pages/Introduction.aspx') %></p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="px-3">
      <summary class="p-2">
        <h2 class="mb-1">Extreme weather advice</h2>
      </summary>
      <div class="text-block p-2">
        <p>The forecasts show the minimum and maximum hourly temperatures predicted over a 24-hour period.</p>

        <div class="scale-guide">
          <section>
            <div class="scale">
              <h3>Heatwave</h3>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:temperature, :high_temp)) %>
          </section>
          <section>
            <div class="scale">
              <h3>Cold weather</h3>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:temperature, :low_temp)) %>
          </section>
        </div>

        <p>Learn more about <%= link_to('how to cope in a heatwave', 'http://www.nhs.uk/Livewell/Summerhealth/Pages/Heatwave.aspx') %>.</p>
        <p>Learn more about <%= link_to('staying well in cold weather', 'http://www.nhs.uk/Livewell/Winterhealth/Pages/Winterhealthhome.aspx') %>.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="px-3">
      <summary class="p-2">
        <h2 class="mb-1">Ultraviolet (UV) rays advice</h2>
      </summary>
      <div class="text-block p-2">
        <p>The UV forecasts predict the maximum hourly cloud-adjusted solar UV index over 24 hours. The higher the UV index number, the less time it takes for the sun to damage your skin.</p>

        <div class="scale-guide">
          <section>
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>Low</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-1">1</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-2">2</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:uv, :low)) %>
          </section>

          <section>
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>Moderate</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-3">3</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-4">4</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-5">5</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:uv, :moderate)) %>
          </section>

          <section>
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>High</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-6">6</span>
              <span class="daqi-level-7">7</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:uv, :high)) %>
          </section>

          <section>
            <div class="scale daqi-scale">
              <h3>Very high</h3>
              <span class="daqi-level-8">8+</span>
            </div>
            <%= render(HealthGuidanceComponent.new(:uv, :very_high)) %>
          </section>
        </div>

        <p><%= link_to('Lear more about sun safety', 'https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/about-cancer/causes-of-cancer/sun-uv-and-cancer/the-uv-index-and-sunburn-risk') %> on the Cancer Research UK website.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <div class="p-3">
    <%= render "shared/back_to_top" %>
  </div>
</article>

<%= render "shared/sidebar" %>
